  "problem": "Evaluate the following matrix product:\n\n|  | $2$ | $0$ | $1$ |  |  |  | $1$ | $2$ | $1$ |  |  |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} | $5$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $3$ | $-1$ | $4$ |  |  |  | $3$ | $0$ | $2$ |  | $=$ |  | {{field-3}} | $10$ | {{field-4}} |  |\n|  | $0$ | $2$ | $5$ |  |  |  | $2$ | $1$ | $3$ |  |  |  | $16$ | {{field-5}} | $19$ |  |",
